%% aoneahsan-cccs-task-planning — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Approved design OR resume request]) --> exists{Tracker already<br/>exists for this feature?}
    exists -->|yes| resume[Read tracker → first pending/in_progress sub-task.<br/>NEVER re-plan from zero]
    exists -->|no| size{3+ files OR 2+ sessions?}

    size -->|no| direct[No tracker — small change;<br/>still plan the steps + gate]
    size -->|yes| write[Write the plan in ~/.claude/plans/:<br/>global constraints up front,<br/>bite-sized tasks, exact paths,<br/>complete content, task interfaces]

    write --> note[Gate cycle per step — typecheck/lint/build<br/>+ run-to-verify. NO write-the-failing-test steps<br/>unless the design asks for tests]
    note --> selfreview{Self-review: coverage,<br/>no placeholders, type/name consistency}
    selfreview -->|gaps| write
    selfreview -->|clean| scaffold[Scaffold docs/features/slug/00-tracker.json<br/>+ overview in the FIRST commit;<br/>human-only sub-tasks → awaitingUser + MANUAL-TASKS.md]

    scaffold --> execute
    resume --> execute
    direct --> execute
    execute[Execute a step → run its gate → mark complete →<br/>append runHistory row. Checkpoint at task boundaries]
    execute --> blocker{Blocker / ambiguity /<br/>contradicts constraints?}
    blocker -->|yes| stop[Stop + ask — aoneahsan-cccs-ask-the-owner.<br/>Do not force through]
    blocker -->|no| more{More sub-tasks?}
    more -->|yes| execute
    more -->|no| done([Plan complete — one commit per prompt])

    scaffold -.schema.-> reg[(../rules/feature-trackers.md)]

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class exists,size,selfreview,blocker,more gate
    class trigger,done terminal
    class stop warn
